	(text "Notes:\n1) Per cycle: PUNCH_SYNC → FIFO_ADVANCE → PUNCH_REG_CLK → BUF_REG_FULL cleared. On \n   a cycle with no character, the punch register is cleared instead.\n2) PUNCH_SPROCKET_EN is sampled with each character and held high by R13. The serial \n   board leaves it open."
